<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Turkish. Android picks this by itself on a Turkish phone, which is the right
  behaviour and the reason there is no language setting on this screen: the
  phone already knows.

  Camera vocabulary is left in English on purpose. ISO, shutter, LUT and log are
  the words printed on every camera body sold here, and translating them would
  make the app harder to read for exactly the people who know what they mean.
-->
